        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Eviscerate"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The rivka has not attacked yet this turn\n\nThe rivka lashes out with four of its razor-like claws. It makes four Strikes: the first at its highest attack bonus, the next two with a \u20134 penalty to their attack rolls, and the last one with a \u20138 penalty. This ability counts as four Strikes for the purpose of its multiple attack penalty."
            },
