        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Kaiju Ray"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, primal)\n\nThe rivka opens its maw and projects a 60-foot line of primal energy that deals 14d6 damage (32 basic Reflex save). The type of damage dealt by the ray depends on which kaiju the rivka has most recently fed from (see above). The rivka can't use Kaiju Ray again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
